  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sponsor destitute university students in Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project provides fourteen full university scholarships (undergraduate programs) to young underprivileged students who graduated from our school and have been affected directly or indirectly by the Liberian civil war, Ebola, and extreme poverty and who otherwise would not be able to afford their schooling. It is our hope that through this project, we train these youths to become teachers and will come back to our school to help provide quality education to other underprivileged students.</narrative>
  </description>
